# Core Layer Conventions

`lib/core/` is shared infrastructure — **no feature-specific logic**.

## Subfolders

| Folder | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `config/` | Env-based app config (`AppConfig`) |
| `constants/` | Design tokens, routes |
| `errors/` | `Failure`, `Exception` types |
| `network/` | `DioFactory`, interceptors |
| `storage/` | Hive, secure storage, preferences services |
| `theme/` | `AppTheme` |
| `utils/` | Debouncer, extensions |

## DioFactory

- Single singleton; configured once at app startup
- Provides Dio instance used by Retrofit API clients in feature `data/api/` layers
- Features access network only through datasources → Retrofit interfaces

## Storage Split

- **Secure**: tokens → `flutter_secure_storage`
- **Structured cache**: movie lists → Hive
- **Simple flags**: onboarding done → `shared_preferences`

Do not import `lib/features/` from `lib/core/`.
